			desc = "Place a 250-health ritual bell inside a 7-metre circle. It tolls three times at 1.2-second intervals: first applies one Hex, second deals 90 damage, third consumes up to three Hexes per enemy for 35 damage each. Destroying the bell cancels remaining tolls.",
