			statline = "CD 7 s | E 15 | H 5 | W 0.35 s | R 16 m",
			desc = "In Yin, release a 55-damage crescent that grants you 35 shield if it hits. In Yang, release an 85-damage crescent with no shield. Each version moves the dial toward its stance only on completion.",
